        {
            "Problem": [
                "`f(x) = sqrt(x)`<br>",
                "a) Find `L(x)` of `f(x)` at `x = %x%`"
            ],
            "Answer": [
                "a) `%ans%`"
            ],
            "Explanation": [
                "`f(x) = sqrt(x)`",
                "`f'(x) = 1/(2sqrt(x))`",
                "A value near %x% where we can find f(x) is %a%, so `a = %a%`",
                "The formula `L(x)` is `L(x) = f(a) + f'(a)(x - a)`, so we must find f(a) and f'(a)",
                "`f(%a%) = %f(a)%`",
                "`f'(%a%) = 1/(2sqrt(%a%))` => `%f'(a)%`",
                "Plugging into formula: `L(%x%) = %f(a)% + (%f'(a)%)(%x% - %a%)`",
                "`L(%x%) = %ans%`"
            ]
        },
        {
            "Problem": [
                "`f(x) = %eq%`",
                "`a = %a%`<br>",
                "a) Find `L(x)` of `f(x)`",
                "b) Find `L(%x%)`"
            ],
            "Answer":[
                "a) `L(x) = %f(a)% + %f'(a)%(x-%a%)`",
                "b) `%ans%`"
            ],
            "Explanation":[
                "<span class='sep'>a)</span>",
                "`f(x) = %eq%`",
                "`f'(x) = %deriv%`",
                "We use these to find at a",
                "`f(%a%) = %eqa%`",
                "`f(%a%) = %f(a)%`",
                "`f'(%a%) = %deriva%`",
                "`f'(%a%) = %f'(a)%`",
                "Plug into `L(x) = f(a) + f'(a)(x-a)`",
                "`L(x) = f(%a%) + f'(%a%)(x-%a%)`",
                "`L(x) = %f(a)% + %f'(a)%(x-%a%)`",
                "<span class='sep'>b)</span>",
                "Plug into `L(x) = %f(a)% + %f'(a)%(x-%a%)`",
                "`L(%x%) = %f(a)% + %f'(a)%(%x%-%a%)`",
                "`L(%x%) = %ans%`"
            ]
        }
